    "clinicalAlerts": "• Resuscitation and suctioning equipment should be available throughout the procedure.\n• Possible complications include: Allergic reaction to dye, arterial embolism or stroke, arterial occlusion due to disruption of arteriosclerotic plaque or dissection of arterial lining, bleeding at the puncture site, infection at the puncture site, renal failure.",
