    "clinicalAlerts": "• Unless contraindicated, aspirin therapy should be considered for symptomatic and asymptomatic patients undergoing CE prior to surgery and for at least 3 months following surgery to reduce the combined endpoint of stroke, myocardial infarction, and death.",
