    "contributingFactors": "• Bedrest, infections, smoking, and stress may alter test results.\n• Intake of low carbohydrate diet may falsely suggest diabetes mellitus or IGT.\n• Drugs which may increase glucose tolerance: hypoglycemic agents, insulin.\n• Drugs which may decrease glucose tolerance: corticosteroids, estrogens, niacin, thiazide diuretics.",
