    "contributingFactors": "• Hemolysis of the sample will alter test results.",
    "clinicalAlerts": "• Explain to the pregnant patient that, should genital herpes be present at the time of delivery, cesarean section may be necessary.\n• Sexual partners of patients testing positive for HSV-2 should also be tested. Education is needed regarding prevention of transmission, treatment during active infection, and suppression therapy.",
