    "title": "Pelvic Sonogram (Gynecologic Sonogram, Obstetric Sonogram, Pelvic Echogram, Pelvic Ultrasound, Transvaginal Ultrasound)",
    "aliases": "Gynecologic Sonogram, Obstetric Sonogram, Pelvic Echogram, Pelvic Ultrasound, Transvaginal Ultrasound",
