        "relatedTests": "`Microalbuminuria` (P.415), `Creatinine, Urine` (P.206).",
        "content": "- **Urine Albumin-to-Creatinine Ratio (UACR) Diagnostic Criteria**:\n  - **Normal**: UACR < 30 mcg/mg creatinine (< 3 mg/mmol);\n  - **Microalbuminuria (Persistent Early Renal Damage)**: UACR **30–299 mcg/mg** creatinine on at least 2 of 3 spot urine collections over a 3- to 6-month period;\n  - **Macroalbuminuria (Overt Diabetic Nephropathy)**: UACR **≥ 300 mcg/mg** creatinine.\n  - **Screening Schedule**: Annual screening starting 5 years post-diagnosis in Type 1 DM, and immediately at diagnosis in Type 2 DM."
