        "content": "- **Diagnostic Criteria & Laboratory Pathway**:\n  1. **Initial Screening**: Serum Insulin-Like Growth Factor 1 (IGF-1 / Somatomedin C). Elevated age- and sex-adjusted IGF-1 has >95% sensitivity.\n  2. **Confirmatory Gold Standard**: Oral Glucose Tolerance Test for GH Suppression (OGTT-GH Suppression Test). Normal response: 75g oral glucose suppresses serum GH to **< 1.0 ng/mL** (ultra-sensitive assay < 0.4 ng/mL). Failure of suppression confirms acromegaly."
