        "content": "- **Biochemical Diagnostic Patterns**:\n  - **Overt Primary Hyperthyroidism**: Serum TSH **< 0.01 mU/L** (suppressed) with elevated Free T4 and/or Free T3.\n  - **Subclinical Hyperthyroidism**: Suppressed TSH with normal Free T4 and Free T3.\n  - **Graves Disease Differentiation**: Diffuse elevated radioactive iodine uptake (RAIU) and positive **TSH Receptor Antibodies (TRAb / TSI)**."
