        "content": "- **Diagnostic Classification**:\n  - **Small Cell Lung Cancer (SCLC)**:\n    - Limited Stage: Confined to one hemithorax and regional lymph nodes encompassed in a single tolerable radiotherapy port;\n    - Extensive Stage: Distant metastases or disease extending beyond limited-stage boundaries.\n  - **Non-Small Cell Lung Cancer (NSCLC)**: TNM staging based on primary tumor size, nodal stations, and distant metastases (PET-CT and brain MRI)."
